# LifeControl - Secret file template: keycloak_admin_client_secret
# Client secret of the 'life-control-admin-client' confidential client in the
# 'life-control-realm'. Copy to docker/secrets/keycloak_admin_client_secret and
# replace the CHANGEME value with the real client secret. The file will be
# mounted read-only into the lifecontrol-api container at /run/secrets/.
#
# Do NOT commit the materialized secrets file (gitignored via docker/secrets/*).
# setup-env.sh prod copies this template (stripping comment lines) and chmod 0444.
CHANGEME